  "description": "Reads .xlsx files and materializes strongly-typed DTOs using the attributes from Cayaqui.Metadata (ImportAlias, ImportColumn, ImportCulture, ImportDefault, ImportTrim, ImportRegex) plus resolver-based TryParse. Uses Syncfusion XlsIO for spreadsheet access. Proprietary — requires a commercial agreement with Cayaqui.",
